	"notice": "This entry covers the Streichfett hardware module rather than the Streichfett plug-in. Connect a MIDI keyboard or sequencer over USB MIDI or DIN. Configure the receive channel and use the hardware split/layer settings to determine how the strings and solo sections respond. Patch recall can change panel parameter values. Exact browser MIDI port aliases have not been verified; select this profile manually. DIN-connected hardware appears under the MIDI interface name. Physical controls are unbound and this profile does not supply a complete MIDI implementation. Diagrams show selected physical controls with illustrative positions; consult the linked manufacturer references for the full panel.",
